<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ماريه وحيدر</title>

  <style>
    *{
      margin:0;
      padding:0;
      box-sizing:border-box;
      font-family: "Cairo", sans-serif;
    }

    body{
      background:#000;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      align-items:center;
      height:100vh;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .chat-box{
      width:380px;
      background:#050816;
      border-radius:30px;
      padding:20px;
      box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(106,90,255,0.3);
      animation:fadeIn 1.2s ease;
    }

    .msg{
      max-width:80%;
      padding:14px 18px;
      margin:12px 0;
      border-radius:25px;
      font-size:22px;
      color:white;
      line-height:1.6;
      animation:slideUp .7s ease;
    }

    .left{
      background:#0f1228;
      border:2px solid rgba(120,120,255,.2);
      margin-right:auto;
    }

    .right{
      background:#2c2c2c;
      margin-left:auto;
    }

    .new-msg{
      text-align:center;
      color:#aaa;
      margin:20px 0;
      font-size:20px;
      position:relative;
    }

    .new-msg::before,
    .new-msg::after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      top:50%;
      width:30%;
      height:1px;
      background:#666;
    }

    .new-msg::before{
      right:0;
    }

    .new-msg::after{
      left:0;
    }

    .link-box{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      background:#080b18;
      border:2px solid rgba(120,120,255,.2);
      border-radius:25px;
      padding:14px 18px;
      margin-top:15px;
      color:#8d7bff;
      font-size:20px;
    }

    .send-btn{
      width:50px;
      height:50px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:#2f2f2f;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      align-items:center;
      color:white;
      font-size:24px;
      margin-right:10px;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn{
      from{
        opacity:0;
        transform:scale(.9);
      }
      to{
        opacity:1;
        transform:scale(1);
      }
    }

    @keyframes slideUp{
      from{
        opacity:0;
        transform:translateY(30px);
      }
      to{
        opacity:1;
        transform:translateY(0);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="chat-box">

    <div class="msg left">
      حيدر عندي هدية الج كلش راح تحبيها 💜
    </div>

    <div class="msg right">
      الله شنو هي؟ 🌚
    </div>

    <div class="new-msg">New Messages</div>

    <div class="link-box">
      <span>🔗 https://marie-haider.app</span>
      <div class="send-btn">➤</div>
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
